{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Andrew Wilson","description":"A sourced person graph about Andrew Wilson, creator and host of The Crucible and a debate instructor associated with Debate University.","graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","version":"1.0.0","kind":"person","created":"2026-08-08T04:08:00-05:00","modified":"2026-08-08T04:08:00-05:00","author":"","tags":["person","debate","the-crucible","debate-university"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"andrew-wilson-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Andrew Wilson Declaration","position":{"x":-1200,"y":-900},"width":460,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","name":"Andrew Wilson","version":"1.0.0","description":"A sourced person graph about Andrew Wilson, creator and host of The Crucible and a debate instructor associated with Debate University.","createdAt":"2026-08-08T04:08:00-05:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-08T04:08:00-05:00"},"intent":{"kind":"person","scope":"public"},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","port","person","biography","role","work","media","claim","evidence","source","bridge"],"portContracts":["core"],"skills":[],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":[]},"authority":{"mode":"graph","mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}},"settings":{"layout":{"mode":"autoOnMissingPositions","defaultLayout":"layered","direction":"DOWN"},"autoSave":false},"declaration":{"kind":"graph","targetMode":"artifact","artifactKind":"graph","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"view","label":"Profile","viewNodeId":"andrew-wilson-profile-surface"},{"id":"profile","kind":"view","label":"Profile","viewNodeId":"andrew-wilson-profile-surface"},{"id":"research","kind":"view","label":"Research","viewNodeId":"andrew-wilson-research-surface"},{"id":"icon","kind":"view","label":"Icon","viewNodeId":"andrew-wilson-icon-surface"}]},"template":{"sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person-template.node","version":"2.0.0","classBacked":true}}},{"id":"andrew-wilson-profile-surface","type":"port","label":"Andrew Wilson","position":{"x":-650,"y":-900},"width":680,"height":420,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","portId":"root","name":"Andrew Wilson"},"target":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","mode":"navigate"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# Andrew Wilson\n\n**Debater • creator and host of The Crucible • Debate University instructor**\n\nAndrew Wilson is an online political and cultural debater known for long-form and “bloodsport” debate formats. His own public materials identify him with **The Crucible** and present him as an instructor in informal debate and logic through **Debate University**.\n\n### Public self-description\n- Paleoconservative\n- Christian\n- Husband and father\n- “Bloodsports” debater\n- Host of The Crucible\n\n### Current relevance\nIn 2026, Wilson became more closely associated with Turning Point USA after publicly saying the organization brought him in to help train campus debaters. That relationship is recorded here as an **attributed current claim**, not treated as an employment fact beyond what the cited material supports.\n\nThis graph separates Wilson’s durable public biography from claims, appearances, and current controversies.","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"graph.web.profile","label":"Andrew Wilson"},"payload":"graph.web.profile","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"andrew-wilson-research-surface","type":"port","label":"Research","position":{"x":-650,"y":-380},"width":680,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","portId":"research","name":"Andrew Wilson Research"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# Sources & provenance\n\nThis profile favors **first-party or primary-host sources** for durable identity and work, then clearly labels newer claims.\n\n1. **The Crucible** — official site and debate archive.\n2. **Debate University** — official course site describing Wilson as creator/host of The Crucible and an instructor with extensive debate experience.\n3. **PBD Podcast, Ep. 707** — long-form December 2025 interview focused on Wilson’s personal story, faith, debate culture, politics, and worldview.\n4. **Bloodsport Debate, June 29, 2026** — secondary report quoting Wilson’s statement that TPUSA brought him in to train campus debaters.\n\nUnknown or weakly sourced biographical details such as birth date, birthplace, and private family information are intentionally omitted.","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"graph.web.research","label":"Sources & provenance"},"payload":"graph.web.research","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"andrew-wilson-icon-surface","type":"port","label":"Andrew Wilson Icon","position":{"x":100,"y":-900},"width":420,"height":280,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph","portId":"icon","name":"Andrew Wilson Icon"},"renderShape":{"kind":"svg"},"svg":"<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 420 280' width='100%' height='100%'><defs><linearGradient id='bg' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='1'><stop offset='0%' stop-color='#111827'/><stop offset='100%' stop-color='#7c2d12'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='420' height='280' rx='28' fill='url(#bg)'/><circle cx='210' cy='112' r='62' fill='#f59e0b' opacity='0.14'/><text x='210' y='134' text-anchor='middle' fill='#fef3c7' font-family='ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='58' font-weight='850'>AW</text><text x='210' y='205' text-anchor='middle' fill='#ffffff' font-family='ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='24' font-weight='800'>ANDREW WILSON</text><text x='210' y='235' text-anchor='middle' fill='#fdba74' font-family='ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='13' font-weight='700' letter-spacing='2'>THE CRUCIBLE • DEBATE</text></svg>","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"graph.web.icon","label":"Andrew Wilson"},"payload":"graph.web.icon","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"person","type":"person","label":"Andrew Wilson","position":{"x":100,"y":-480},"width":440,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"displayName":"Andrew Wilson","fullName":"Andrew Wilson","aliases":[],"summary":"Online political and cultural debater; creator and host of The Crucible; debate instructor associated with Debate University.","portrait":"","birthDate":"","deathDate":"","pronouns":"","nationality":"","primaryRoles":["Debater","Host of The Crucible","Debate instructor"],"canonicalUri":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/andrew-wilson.node","status":"active","definitionKey":"person","_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"identity":{"graphId":"andrew-wilson-person-graph"}}},{"id":"biography","type":"biography","label":"Public Biography","position":{"x":620,"y":-480},"width":440,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Public Biography","summary":"Wilson built a public profile around onlin